			"notes": "## 1.1.3 - Vendors Update\n\n### New\n- **More vendors**: Frank, Big Cheese and most of the hidden vendors are now in the recipe viewer.\n- **Filter by Rarity**: the filter button in vendor menus now works. Click it to go to the next rarity (right-click for the previous one).\n- **Several NPCs per vendor**: use the < and > arrows under the NPC to switch between them.\n- **Event Loot tab**: the Minor, Major and Mega Halloween Raffles, with their rewards, chances and the path to their NPC.\n- **Emotes** *(coming soon)*: emotes in the widget wheel with a live preview of your skin. They can animate your body, add effects, music and particles around you, and other mod users see them too. Emote sounds can be turned off in the Widgets settings.\n\n### Changes\n- **Cosmetic tooltips** now show their bonus line and the Arcane Bonus like on MCC Island.\n- **Menus** now follow your GUI Scale (GUI Scale 3 keeps the previous size)."
		},
